-- Recommended documents added per visa type (see lib/visa-template-seed-data.ts).
-- Additive and idempotent: every new item is not required, existing items and flags are
-- never changed, and guidance text is only updated where it still matches the previous
-- built-in text (text an admin edited is left alone).

